{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122154109303-1122_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261122154253\"/><p>糖果廠陷入火海。</p><p>印尼萬丹省塞朗縣一座糖果廠上周六（21日）發生大火，至周日（22日）造成3人死亡，4人受傷，仍有36名工人失聯，搜救隊繼續搜索。</p><p>工廠是一座3層建築，目擊者指最先起火的是3樓冷卻裝置，大部分區域陷入火海，部分更燒通屋頂。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:56:50.085110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:41:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:12.284104+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:50:25.301941+00:00","content_hash":"dd4e35ebe9e3a4ee269327c9204baf513ce78af0b1c36fd9eabde83452d28ee7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}